1966. Ann Arbor, Michigan, is the", "x": 10.46, "y": 49.34, "w": 23.55, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "closest city of size to the Dexter gas event", "x": 10.42, "y": 50.37, "w": 22.74, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": ".", "x": 62.98, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.23, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "W", "x": 63.48, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.68, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "R", "x": 64.44, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.51, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "T", "x": 65.23, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.44, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "T", "x": 65.95, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.44, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "J", "x": 66.67, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.43, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "s", "x": 67.37, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.37, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "r", "x": 68.02, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.31, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "m", "x": 68.61, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.67, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": ".", "x": 69.55, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.23, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "N", "x": 70.06, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.53, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": ".", "x": 70.86, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.23, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "w", "x": 71.37, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.55, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "x", "x": 72.2, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.4, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": ",", "x": 72.87, "y": 77.22, "w": 0.45, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "TO", "x": 63.19, "y": 77.67, "w": 1.35, "h": 0.94, "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "DON'T", "x": 64.54, "y": 77.67, "w": 3.61, "h": 0.94, "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "fAAKE", "x": 68.15, "y": 77.67, "w": 3.6, "h": 0.94, "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "a", "x": 63.16, "y": 78.27, "w": 1.37, "h": 2.4, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "s", "x": 65.51, "y": 78.27, "w": 1.37, "h": 2.4, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "m", "x": 67.85, "y": 78.27, "w": 2.18, "h": 2.4, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "*", "x": 71.02, "y": 78.27, "w": 1.64, "h": 2.4, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "^SESYMPW, ,", "x": 62.92, "y": 80.16, "w": 11.2