"According", "x": 8.09, "y": 67.86, "w": 7.09, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "fo a/i air", "x": 15.18, "y": 67.84, "w": 4.56, "h": 1.09, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "force spokesman,", "x": 19.74, "y": 67.86, "w": 12.42, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the rfCtnl rssh of", "x": 6.4, "y": 68.52, "w": 11.04, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "U", "x": 17.44, "y": 68.52, "w": 1.28, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "F", "x": 18.71, "y": 68.52, "w": 1.05, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "O", "x": 19.77, "y": 68.51, "w": 1.37, "h": 1.09, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "uHhtir.fr", "x": 21.13, "y": 68.52, "w": 6.24, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was", "x": 27.37, "y": 68.51, "w": 2.21, "h": 1.09, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "nothing", "x": 29.58, "y": 68.52, "w": 5.77, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "more th*n", "x": 6.3, "y": 69.18, "w": 6.41, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "J c/oud", "x": 12.72, "y": 69.59, "w": 3.12, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "of", "x": 15.83, "y": 69.18, "w": 1.5, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "iwjrmp las", "x": 17.33, "y": 69.59, "w": 4.43, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "S'a/", "x": 23.3, "y": 69.59, "w": 1.61, "h": 0.56, "fontSize": 4.2}, {"text": "turrri", "x": 24.91, "y": 69.18, "w": 4.21, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "for", "x": 6.89, "y": 69.85, "w": 1.79, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "an", "x": 8.68, "y": 69.83, "w": 1.59, "h": 1.09, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "update on the 12 Milwaukee rcudenli", "x": 10.27, "y": 69.85, "w": 25.43, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "reportedly hdmpped by the \\wemp gtt", "x": 6.83, "y": 70.51, "w": 25.22, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": ".\"", "x": 32.05, "y": 70.51, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.07, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "A few examples of political cartoons", "x": 4.21, "y": 72.55, "w": 19.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "which appeared in papers across the", "x": 4.21, "y": 73.56, "w": 20.04, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "country and poked fun at the Hynek", "x": 4.21, "y": 74.56, "w": 19.32, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "explanation of swamp gas being the", "x": 4.21, "y": 75.56, "w": 19.61, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "culprit in the Michigan sightings.", "x": 4.24, "y": 76.56, "w": 17.81, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "These examples were obtained from", "x": 4.18, "y": 77.56, "w": 19.66, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the files of The Center for UFO Studies", "x": 4.21, "y": 78.56, "w": 20.39, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "(CUFOS) located in Evanston, Illinois.", "x": 4.27, "y": 79.57, "w": 19.65, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "The story was generally greeted across the", "x": 67.62, "y": 68.09, "w": 27.32, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "country with laughter, ridicule, and derisive-", "x": 67.56, "y": 69.33, "w": 27.26, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ness. Hynek would leave Michigan, as he", "x": 67.68, "y": 70.57, "w": 26.49, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "later said, \"as quickly and as quietly as I", "x": 67.65, "y": 71.8, "w": 25.43, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "could'.", "x": 67.65, "y": 73.04, "w": 4.3, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": ">", "x": 71.95, "y": 73.04, "w": 2.08, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "The News Conference", "x": 67.4, "y": 4.87, "w": 23.67, "h": 2.37, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "UFOs Come", "x": 37.12, "y": 4.91, "w": 12.37, "h": 2.37, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "To", "x": 49.48, "y": 4.91, "w": 3.18, "h": 2.37, "fontSize": 17.7}, {"text": "Michigan", "x": 52.66, "y": 4.91, "w": 10.74, "h": 2.37, "fontSize": 17.6}, {"text": "A week before the Dexter UFO event there", "x": 36.96, "y": 7.35, "w": 26.65, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "were reports from Michigan citizens and", "x": 36.96, "y": 8.59, "w": 25.46, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "police officers in three different counties of", "x": 37.02, "y": 9.83, "w": 27.03, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "objects moving at fantastic speeds, hovering,", "x": 36.99, "y": 11.06, "w": 28.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "climbing and diving. One report cited a police", "x": 36.99, "y": 12.3, "w": 28.74, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "officer having a UFO approach his squad car", "x": 36.99, "y": 13.53, "w": 28.28, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "to within seventy-five feet, causing his police", "x": 36.96, "y": 14.77, "w": 28.22, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "radio to stop functioning. Some of these were", "x": 37.05, "y": 16.01, "w": 28.74, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "far better UFO reports for the press to focus", "x": 36.99, "y": 17.24, "w": 27.76, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "on than what had been reported in the Dexter", "x": 37.02, "y": 18.48, "w": 28.59, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "case. But it was the latter case, along with the", "x": 37.02, "y": 19.71, "w": 28.8, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Hillsdale case, that captured the attention of", "x": 37.08, "y": 20.95, "w": 27.68, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the press and the nation at large.", "x": 36.99, "y": 22.19, "w": 20.97, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "While in Michigan, Hynek was met by hordes", "x": 37.08, "y": 24.68, "w": 28.41, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "of reporters. He donned boots and sloshed", "x": 37.02, "y": 25.92, "w": 27.34, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "around in the swamps. He rode with police", "x": 37.02, "y": 27.15, "w": 27.05, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "and described a scene of \"near hysteria\" as", "x": 37.02, "y": 28.39, "w": 27.67, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "people reported seeing UFOs and squad cars", "x": 37.08, "y": 29.62, "w": 28.81, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "chase about after fleeting lights in the sky.", "x": 37.05, "y": 30.86, "w": 26.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "He later noted, \"The scene that greeted me", "x": 37.15, "y": 32.1, "w": 27.02, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was one of utter confusion, much like the", "x": 37.02, "y": 33.33, "w": 26.03, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "crowd that gathers around the scene of a cat-", "x": 37.05, "y": 34.57, "w": 28.37, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "astrophe, or perhaps it might be likened to a", "x": 37.05, "y": 35.81, "w": 28.08, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "circus, with many rings in full action.\"(4)", "x": 37.12, "y": 37.04, "w": 25.24, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "With this chaotic situation in full swing, and", "x": 37.05, "y": 39.58, "w": 27.34, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the press calling for an explanation, the Air", "x": 37.02, "y": 40.81, "w": 27.05, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Force ordered that a news conference was to", "x": 37.02, "y": 42.05, "w": 28.65, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "be held on March 25, only five days after the", "x": 37.12, "y": 43.29, "w": 28.0, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Dexter sighting. Hynek was the man of the", "x": 37.15, "y": 44.52, "w": 26.65, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "hour and also the man on the spot. The news", "x": 37.12, "y": 45.76, "w": 28.56, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "conference was held at the Detroit Press Club", "x": 37.18, "y": 46.99, "w": 28.89, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "located in Detroit.", "x": 37.15, "y": 48.23, "w": 11.35, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Hynek's instructions were to release a state-", "x": 67.5, "y": 7.33, "w": 27.57, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ment about the cause of the sightings.", "x": 67.56, "y": 8.55, "w": 24.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "As Hynek later said, \"It did me no good to", "x": 67.44, "y": 11.02, "w": 26.56, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "protest, to say that as yet I had no real idea", "x": 67.5, "y": 12.25, "w": 27.34, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "what had caused the reported sightings in the", "x": 67.4, "y": 13.49, "w": 29.08, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "swamp. I was to have a press conference,", "x": 67.47, "y": 14.73, "w": 26.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ready or not.\"", "x": 67.44, "y": 15.96, "w": 8.88, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Hynek then offered a possible explanation for", "x": 67.53, "y": 18.44, "w": 28.72, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the sightings. Hynek described the properties", "x": 67.44, "y": 19.67, "w": 28.87, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "of swamp gas, which he said he learned", "x": 67.47, "y": 20.91, "w": 25.52, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "about from a University of Michigan profes-", "x": 67.47, "y": 22.14, "w": 27.07, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "sor. He pointed out that decaying vegetation", "x": 67.5, "y": 23.38, "w": 27.89, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "can create certain gasses and, under certain", "x": 67.5, "y": 24.62, "w": 28.11, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "circumstances, ignite and cast a flickering", "x": 67.5, "y": 25.85, "w": 26.54, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "flame. He pointed out that the light can", "x": 67.47, "y": 27.09, "w": 24.6, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "flicker out in one place and suddenly appear", "x": 67.47, "y": 28.32, "w": 28.16, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "in another place and that this can create the", "x": 67.53, "y": 29.56, "w": 27.72, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "appearance of motion. No heat is felt, there", "x": 67.56, "y": 30.8, "w": 27.26, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "are no burn marks, no smell, and the lights", "x": 67.5, "y": 32.03, "w": 27.18, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "can burn for extended periods of time. There", "x": 67.56, "y": 33.27, "w": 28.19, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "may be popping sounds.", "x": 67.56, "y": 34.51, "w": 15.9, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Hynek repeatedly said that his explanation", "x": 67.56, "y": 37.06, "w": 26.81, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was not, \"a blanket statement to cover", "x": 67.5, "y": 38.3, "w": 24.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "the entire UFO phenomenon\", and that, \"I", "x": 67.47, "y": 39.54, "w": 26.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "cannot prove in a Court of Law that this is the", "x": 67.59, "y": 40.77, "w": 28.71, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "full explanation of these sightings\".", "x": 67.5, "y": 42.01, "w": 22.33, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "As it turned out, a press conference was not a", "x": 67.5, "y": 44.52, "w": 29.18, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "place for scholarly discussion of the proper-", "x": 67.59, "y": 45.76, "w": 27.57, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ties of swamp gas. Hynek later would remem-", "x": 67.5, "y": 46.99, "w": 28.61, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ber the scene as chaotic. \"Everyone was", "x": 67.59, "y": 48.23, "w": 25.73, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "clamoring for a single, spectacular explana-", "x": 67.56, "y": 49.47, "w": 27.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "tion of the sightings. They wanted little", "x": 67.5, "y": 50.7, "w": 24.46, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "green men. When I handed out a statement", "x": 67.5, "y": 51.94, "w": 27.38, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "that discussed swamp gas, many of the men", "x": 67.53, "y": 53.18, "w": 28.29, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "simply ignored the fact that I said it was a", "x": 67.65, "y": 54.41, "w": 26.26, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "'possible' reason. I watched in horror as one", "x": 67.68, "y": 55.65, "w": 28.03, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "reporter scanned the page, found the phrase", "x": 67.59, "y": 56.88, "w": 28.34, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "'swamp gas', underlined it and rushed for the", "x": 67.62, "y": 58.12, "w": 28.58, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "telephone.\"", "x": 67.56, "y": 59.36, "w": 7.42, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "The next day newspaper stories generally", "x": 67.59, "y": 61.91, "w": 26.4, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "reported that swamp gas was the real culprit", "x": 67.62, "y": 63.15, "w": 28.12, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "in the Michigan cases and that swamp gas", "x": 67.65, "y": 64.39, "w": 26.96, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "could explain other UFO cases as well.", "x": 67.62, "y": 65.62, "w": 24.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}]}